From 89b6226b6c2a4add3939f361653a47c212d6ab75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SeongJae Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 14:36:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 322/459] mm/damon/core: disallow non-power of two
