From 2dc8d26690bf4e7226409563221c37bc095c94ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antoniu Miclaus <antoniu.miclaus@analog.com>
Date: Sat, 2 May 2026 20:40:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 411/459] iio: frequency: admv1013: fix NULL pointer
