MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

[ Upstream commit aac0a51b16700b403a55b67ba495de021db78763 ]

When device_property_read_string() fails, str is left uninitialized
